{"product_id":"selling-graphic-design-1st-edition","title":"SELLING GRAPHIC DESIGN, 1ST EDITION","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis reference shows anyone selling design the best ways to find clients, develop lasting relationships with them, and maximize sales. It explains how to write effective proposals, offer design solutions, and provide services to fit a client's needs and budget. Also included are tips on pricing, billing, portfolios, promotion and networking, turning low budgets into successful projects, markets designers may not be aware of, helpful glossaries, and a list of professional organizations and publications.\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Donald Sparkman\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781880559291\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 256\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 159 x 230\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42595540369561,"sku":"10RF9781880559291","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/selling-graphic-design-1st-edition-283176.jpg?v=1694791400","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/selling-graphic-design-1st-edition","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}